direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#17334b"; font-color: white; bold: true}}
}
snapshot: Start here\nFrozen PDF + complete baselines {class: start}
state: Saved geometry revision\nImages + split lineage + sides\nReferences + targets + dispositions
action: Versioned review action\nOne writer, stale actions rejected
local: Accepted local edit\nNew page image\nDependent alignment invalidated
shared: Shared target / reference change\nAffected group alignment invalidated
side: Side / anchor / split change\nAffected placement proposals invalidated
review: Regenerate affected alignment\nScoped preview and acceptance
freeze: Freeze accepted geometry snapshot\nAll occurrences and default order
published: Validate images / canvases / report\nNo-clobber image-only PDF
snapshot -> state: "1. verified import"
state -> action: "2. compare then act"
action -> local: page geometry
action -> shared: group geometry
action -> side: assignment / topology
local -> review: "3. preserve unrelated accepted pages"
shared -> review
side -> review
review -> freeze: "4. affected choices accepted or unresolved"
freeze -> published: "5. one coherent snapshot"
